    "name": "Purple Top Turnip",
    "description": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Purple top turnips have a white, spherical root with a \"purple crown\" where the top is exposed above ground and is purple or magenta.&nbsp;They have a tender white flesh with a spicy flavor and large, lobed greens that are also edible and nutritious.&nbsp;This heirloom variety is easy to grow and commonly used for both human consumption and as a cool-weather forage for livestock and wildlife</span></p>",
